8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Evasive_Instinct\" title=\"Evasive Instinct\">Evasive Instinct</a></dt><dd>You have a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> as long as you are not wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a> or holding a <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">shield</a>.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Vaulting\" title=\"Refined Vaulting\">Refined Vaulting</a></dt><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/38px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/50px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> distance is increased by 1.5 m (5 ft).</dd></dl>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Garb\" title=\"Bonespike Garb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Garb\" title=\"Bonespike Garb\"> <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Bonespike Garb</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/50px-Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Slabjaw_Determination\" title=\"Slabjaw Determination\">Slabjaw Determinatio